# The variables deploy/start.sh needs, as SSM Parameter Store entries under /supporters/<env>/
# (the last path segment is the variable name). This file is documentation: never put real values
# in it, and never copy it to a server. Terraform (infra/) creates the SecureString placeholders
# and the plain String entries marked [terraform]; the rest are set with
#   aws ssm put-parameter --name /supporters/<env>/<NAME> --type SecureString --overwrite --value ...

# ---- Set by Terraform [terraform] ----
# APP_ORIGIN          https://<domain>                    public origin, also the API's CSRF Origin check
# ORIGIN_DOMAIN       origin.<domain>                     the name CloudFront connects to (Caddy's site)
# ORIGIN_VERIFY_SECRET   (SecureString, generated)        value CloudFront sends as X-Origin-Verify
# ACME_DNS_ZONE_ID    Z...                                Route 53 zone for Caddy's DNS-01 challenge
# S3_BUCKET, S3_REGION, MEDIA_PUBLIC_URL, EMAIL_PROVIDER=ses, EMAIL_FROM, SES_REGION
# ECR_REGISTRY, ECR_REPOSITORY_NS                         where start.sh pulls images from

# ---- Set by hand (SecureString) ----
# DATABASE_URL        postgresql://<app-role>:<password>@<rds-endpoint>:5432/supporters?sslmode=verify-full
# VALKEY_PASSWORD     24+ chars of A-Z a-z 0-9 _ -  (used inside a redis:// URL)
# JWT_PRIVATE_KEY     Ed25519 PKCS#8 PEM, or its base64   (`pnpm --filter @supporters/api keys:generate`)
# JWT_KEY_ID          any short id, e.g. 2026-11
# OTP_HMAC_KEY        base64, 32+ bytes
# TOTP_ENCRYPTION_KEY base64, exactly 32 bytes
# MEILI_MASTER_KEY    16+ chars; never given to the API
# MEILI_SEARCH_KEY    scoped keys printed by `search:init` (deploy/README.md, first deploy)
# MEILI_INDEX_KEY
# SENTRY_DSN          optional; empty or missing turns Sentry off

# ---- Optional ----
# LOG_LEVEL, JWT_PREVIOUS_PUBLIC_KEY + JWT_PREVIOUS_KEY_ID (during a key rotation),
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY + VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY + VAPID_SUBJECT, EXPO_ACCESS_TOKEN,
# BREACHED_PASSWORD_CHECK, SMS_PROVIDER, ORIGIN_VERIFY_SECRET_PREVIOUS (during a rotation)
